  "sourceHash": "b2761d617ccfeda2fa34fc11eccdfac2ccdee985fad64fff05aa3d7592aafd54",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "A few years ago, we became the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "We were forced to live among the shadows. Overnight, peace became a luxury for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Originally, we thought that the Reunion Movement would be able to change our lives, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Still, nobody would sell us bread or provide us shelter. Nothing had changed at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "My brothers and I left, and we drifted from place to place until we heard about the treasure. That is what brought me here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "This time, if we're able to get our hands on the treasure..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "We'd be able to travel to Columbia, far, far away. There, the Infected can form communities and even own land."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "That is why... Grani, for my brothers, I need this treasure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "It's not far... I can feel it. You did well, but it's a shame..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hey, lady! You...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Out of my way."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Woah!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "I don't care who you are, or what you plan on doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "But you shall disappear from my sight."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "If there's really no other way, Skadi... then I'll fight you to the very end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "So these are the types of people you've chosen to ally yourself with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "What will happen to Dewville after you take the treasure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "No matter what happens, they will still survive. The same cannot be said for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Even though I haven't known you for long, I can tell what kind of person you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "You aren't prejudiced against the Infected, unlike that monster standing next to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "(Skadi probably isn't prejudiced either... She just wants you out of her way, Infected or not...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Grani, tell me where Carol is!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "You know how much this treasure means to us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Sorry, Big Bob, but that's not a part of my mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "My only mission is to help Carol find the treasure, and restore peace to her village."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "I don't care about any of that. Just hand Carol over to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "What do you need that girl for anyway, you monster?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Do you plan to skin her alive? Drink her blood?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "You already heard the kid. She won't hand the chief over to you no matter what!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "However, I just want the treasure. I won't lay a finger on the girl!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "I've had enough of this... Grani, tell me where Carol is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "All Carol wants is to protect her village. She doesn't even care about the treasure itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "In that case, let me have the treasure then!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "There is little difference between Reunion and the bounty hunters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "I'm nothing like you greed-driven lot!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "I used to be a good-for-nothing just like you, but I've seen the world for what it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Right now, things like status or wealth aren't worth shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "All we want is to survive, and the treasure is going to make that happen!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "I'll say it one more time. Hand Carol over to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "I won't hand over Carol, or the treasure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "This is my mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Grani! You still have a choice! I don't want to fight you when it doesn't do either of us any good!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Just let me have the treasure, and everyone walks away happy!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "We already agreed that we'd give you a share of the treasure, Big Bob!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "But think about my brothers! At least let me see how much treasure there is first!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "If we have to resort to violence, both of you know that you're no match for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "I might not be confident in my abilities, but if I have to fight both of you, then so be it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "At least the two of us can talk things through, Grani!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Then, let's team up and take her down first!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Are you done talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "If we start fighting here, then there really will be no turning back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "We..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Grani!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Look, I found the it! I found the treasure!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "It was really hard to drag it all the way out here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "Mister Bob!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "I'm glad that you're okay—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Stay back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "text": "Huh?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "...Tsk!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "*huff*...*huff*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "There was... never any turning back for us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Huh? Carol!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Skadi!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Why did you use a non-damaging explosive?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "I owe these girls a favor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "But next time, I'll be using the real ones."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Skadi..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "You don't care about the treasure. Nor do you want to hurt Miss Carol."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "That's why you shielded her instead of grabbing the treasure and making a run for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "I'm not after the treasure. What I want is the answer that Carol holds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Why didn't you say so in the first place?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "What's the point of playing the villain anyway? Wouldn't kill you to be a bit more frank."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "I don't want... for others to get caught up in my mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "But the mission objective this time... is very important to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Of course, I can imagine. Even though we have different missions, we're working towards the same thing, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "We should be helping each other out instead!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Tch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "I guess we're going to have to fight over the treasure after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "Skadi, make sure not to hurt him too badly!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "text": "Gra...ni...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "I'm really sorry, Big Bob, but this might hurt a little!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
